{"text":"And while we cannot shake or cast aside or past, every day we write the future. Together, we sign it. Together, we declare it. We share it. For this truth marches on inside each of us, Americans who know one another by our love of liberty. When, in fact, we are liberated by our love for one another, for we understand that a house divided cannot stand. So let's make a pact to be the country that acts as compassionate as we are courageous in the Declaration's pages. We write a new order for the ages where, out of many, we are one, bright as a sun, bold as an eagle, a nation of all people, a nation by all people, a nation for all people. Let this Fourth of July move forth or cry to redeem the dream. Let us live up to those words forever ignited that we, the people, have so long heard and recited today. We dare to declare we are right to stand, but we are revolutionary when we stand united.","words":[{"text":"And","start":0.0,"end":0.52},{"text":"while","start":0.52,"end":0.7},{"text":"we","start":0.7,"end":0.88},{"text":"cannot","start":0.88,"end":1.12},{"text":"shake","start":1.12,"end":1.62},{"text":"or","start":1.62,"end":2.08},{"text":"cast","start":2.08,"end":2.58},{"text":"aside","start":2.58,"end":3.1},{"text":"or","start":3.1,"end":3.42},{"text":"past","start":3.42,"end":3.92,"punct":","},{"text":"every","start":4.5,"end":4.78},{"text":"day","start":4.78,"end":5.22},{"text":"we","start":5.22,"end":5.7},{"text":"write","start":5.7,"end":5.96},{"text":"the","start":5.96,"end":6.26},{"text":"future","start":6.26,"end":6.66,"punct":"."},{"text":"Together","start":7.26,"end":7.7,"punct":","},{"text":"we","start":8.24,"end":8.5},{"text":"sign","start":8.5,"end":8.84},{"text":"it","start":8.84,"end":9.18,"punct":"."},{"text":"Together","start":9.5,"end":9.82,"punct":","},{"text":"we","start":10.34,"end":10.6},{"text":"declare","start":10.6,"end":11.04},{"text":"it","start":11.04,"end":11.26,"punct":"."},{"text":"We","start":11.38,"end":11.46},{"text":"share",